  "last_executor_claim": "Rechecked — all requirements remain satisfied and the deliverable is final:\n\n- **`/app/report.md`** (22 KB, 17 sections) is complete: general principles for parametric pension restructuring, the fiscal-health mechanics of each Ostonian measure (cohort-phased 60→65 retirement age, lifetime-average + 140-divisor formula, 4% deferral credit, 35-year transition exemption), and documented economic consequences — both positive (employment, GDP, fiscal savings) and adverse (UI/DI spillovers, inequality, hidden benefit cuts, reversal risk).\n- **19 distinct corpus sources cited** (D0002–D0152), each verified against its actual file contents; claims carry doc ID + title + URL, with a key-sources table.\n- **Limitations section** states all material gaps: no published actuarial projections or old-formula parameters, no Ostonia-specific data in the corpus, calculator approximations, undefined \"Class A\" scope, pending parliamentary approval.\n- **Input files unmodified** — checksums of `7.html` and `tex.pdf` unchanged; only the two original files remain in `user_files`. No external retrieval used.\n\nNothing left to do — `/app/report.md` is the finished report.",
